	<string>Your location is shown on the route map so you can follow your delivery stops.</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>The camera is used to take proof photos and to scan barcodes and the trader's handoff QR at pickup and delivery stops.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Photos are attached to incident reports and your profile.</string>
